================================================================================
LICENSING OVERVIEW — OPEN-CORE MODEL
================================================================================

NEI uses a layered open-core licensing model. Different components of the
framework are published under different open licenses.

================================================================================
DATA LAYER — CC0 1.0 Universal (Public Domain)
================================================================================

The following components are released into the public domain under
Creative Commons Zero v1.0 Universal (CC0 1.0):

  - Indicator data files  (indicators/concepts/*.yaml, indicators/versions/*.yaml)
  - Taxonomy data files   (taxonomy/nodes/*.csv, taxonomy/edges/*.csv)
  - Release manifests     (releases/*.yaml)

These files may be used, copied, modified, and distributed for any purpose,
including commercial use, without restriction or attribution requirement.

Full license text: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

================================================================================
SPECIFICATION DOCUMENTS — CC BY 4.0
================================================================================

The following specification and governance documents are published under the
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0):

  - Framework documentation  (docs/framework.md)
  - Methodology documentation (docs/methodology.md)
  - Governance procedures    (GOVERNANCE.md)
  - Contributor guide        (CONTRIBUTING.md)
  - This README

You are free to share and adapt these documents for any purpose, including
commercially, provided you give appropriate credit to atypical and
link to the license.

Full license text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

================================================================================
REFERENCE IMPLEMENTATION — Apache 2.0
================================================================================

The nei-python reference implementation library is published under the
Apache License, Version 2.0.

Full license text: https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

================================================================================
IDENTIFIER NAMESPACE — TRADEMARK
================================================================================

The NEI identifier namespace — including identifiers prefixed with NDI-, NDR-,
NDT-, and NDP- — is a trademark of atypical.

  - Internal use of NEI-prefixed identifiers by organizations evaluating their
    own practices is free and requires no license.

  - Commercial use of NEI-prefixed identifiers in products or services
    (outside of internal practice evaluation) requires a license from
    atypical.

================================================================================
PROPRIETARY COMMERCIAL SERVICES
================================================================================

The following services are proprietary to atypical and are not
covered by the open licenses above. A commercial agreement with atypical
is required to offer or access these services:

  - Identifier minting (issuance of new NDI-/NDR-/NDT-/NDP- identifiers)
  - Validation and certification services
  - Participation in the atypical Verifier Program
  - Custom scoring methodology validation and endorsement

